{"code": 200, "status": "OK", "data": [{"number": 96, "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ", "englishName": "Al-Alaq", "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot", "revelationType": "Meccan", "numberOfAyahs": 19, "ayahs": [{"number": 6107, "text": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ٱقْرَأْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ", "numberInSurah": 1, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6108, "text": "خَلَقَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ", "numberInSurah": 2, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6109, "text": "ٱقْرَأْ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلْأَكْرَمُ", "numberInSurah": 3, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6110, "text": "ٱلَّذِى عَلَّمَ بِٱلْقَلَمِ", "numberInSurah": 4, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6111, "text": "عَلَّمَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ", "numberInSurah": 5, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6112, "text": "كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لَيَطْغَىٰٓ", "numberInSurah": 6, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6113, "text": "أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰٓ", "numberInSurah": 7, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6114, "text": "إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجْعَىٰٓ", "numberInSurah": 8, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6115, "text": "أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يَنْهَىٰ", "numberInSurah": 9, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6116, "text": "عَبْدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ", "numberInSurah": 10, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6117, "text": "أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ", "numberInSurah": 11, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6118, "text": "أَوْ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقْوَىٰٓ", "numberInSurah": 12, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6119, "text": "أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ", "numberInSurah": 13, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6120, "text": "أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ", "numberInSurah": 14, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6121, "text": "كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ", "numberInSurah": 15, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6122, "text": "نَاصِيَةٍۢ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍۢ", "numberInSurah": 16, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6123, "text": "فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ", "numberInSurah": 17, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6124, "text": "سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ", "numberInSurah": 18, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6125, "text": "كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩", "numberInSurah": 19, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": {"id": 15, "recommended": false, "obligatory": true}}], "edition": {"identifier": "quran-uthmani", "language": "ar", "name": "القرآن الكريم برسم العثماني (uthmani)", "englishName": "Uthmani", "format": "text", "type": "quran", "direction": "rtl"}}, {"number": 96, "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ", "englishName": "Al-Alaq", "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot", "revelationType": "Meccan", "numberOfAyahs": 19, "ayahs": [{"number": 6107, "text": "Читай во имя твоего Господа, Который сотворил все сущее,", "numberInSurah": 1, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6108, "text": "сотворил человека из сгустка крови.", "numberInSurah": 2, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6109, "text": "Читай, ведь твой Господь - Самый великодушный.", "numberInSurah": 3, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6110, "text": "Он научил посредством письменной трости -", "numberInSurah": 4, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6111, "text": "научил человека тому, чего тот не знал.", "numberInSurah": 5, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6112, "text": "Но нет! Человек преступает границы дозволенного,", "numberInSurah": 6, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6113, "text": "когда ему кажется, что он ни в чем не нуждается.", "numberInSurah": 7, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6114, "text": "Но к твоему Господу предстоит возвращение.", "numberInSurah": 8, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6115, "text": "Что ты думаешь о том, кто мешает", "numberInSurah": 9, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6116, "text": "рабу, когда тот молится?", "numberInSurah": 10, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6117, "text": "Что ты думаешь, а если он был на правом пути", "numberInSurah": 11, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6118, "text": "или призывал к богобоязненности?", "numberInSurah": 12, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6119, "text": "Что ты думаешь, а если он счел ложью истину и отвернулся?", "numberInSurah": 13, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6120, "text": "Неужели он не знал, что Аллах видит его?", "numberInSurah": 14, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6121, "text": "Но нет, если он не перестанет, то Мы схватим его за хохол -", "numberInSurah": 15, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6122, "text": "хохол лживый, грешный.", "numberInSurah": 16, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6123, "text": "Пусть он зовет свое сборище.", "numberInSurah": 17, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6124, "text": "Мы же позовем адских стражей!", "numberInSurah": 18, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number": 6125, "text": "Так нет! Не повинуйся ему, а пади ниц и приближайся к Аллаху.", "numberInSurah": 19, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": {"id": 15, "recommended": false, "obligatory": true}}], "edition": {"identifier": "ru.kuliev", "language": "ru", "name": "Кулиев", "englishName": "Elmir Kuliev", "format": "text", "type": "translation", "direction": "ltr"}}, {"number": 96, "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ", "englishName": "Al-Alaq", "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot", "revelationType": "Meccan", "numberOfAyahs": 19, "ayahs": [{"number": 6107, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6107.mp3", "audioSecondary": ["https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6107.mp3"], "text": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ٱقْرَأْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ", "numberInSurah": 1, "juz": 30, "manzil": 7, "page": 597, "ruku": 538, "hizbQuarter": 239, "sajda": false}, {"number"